MiniToolRL
==========

This project was split from the MiniMind repository for independent Qwen-mainline
research on tool-using customer-service environments.

What this project is
--------------------
Environment, SFT trajectories, in-environment GRPO, three continuation schedules,
and composition evaluation for Qwen3-0.6B. Those experiment protocols and
environment rules are the MiniToolRL research code.

What this project is not claiming
---------------------------------
- MiniMind model architecture, tokenizer, and original training stack belong to
  [jingyaogong/minimind](https://github.com/jingyaogong/minimind) (Apache-2.0).
- Standard SFT and GRPO are established methods, not original
  contributions of this subproject.
- Qwen3 weights, vocabulary, and the Qwen name belong to Alibaba / Qwen.
  The current pipeline uses the unmodified official Qwen3 tokenizer chat
  template at revision c1899de289a04d12100db370d81485cdf75e47ca.
